# 📄 Secure PDF to Editable PowerPoint Converter

A privacy-focused, local-first tool designed for journalists and researchers to convert sensitive PDF news documents into editable PowerPoint (.pptx) presentations.

## 🌟 Why this tool?
Most online converters upload your documents to a cloud server, which poses a security risk for confidential or leaked materials. This tool is built to run **locally** on your machine's resources, ensuring your data never leaves your environment during processing.

## ✨ Key Features
- **Editable Text:** Unlike other tools that just turn PDF pages into images, this extracts text into real, editable PowerPoint text boxes.
- **Privacy-First:** No trackers, no uploads, and no data logging.
- **Optimized for Mac:** Specifically designed to run efficiently on MacBook M1/M2/M3 architecture.
- **Zero Cost:** 100% free to use for the journalism community.

## 🛠️ Built With
- [Python 3.13+](https://www.python.org/)
- [Streamlit](https://streamlit.io/) - Web Interface
- [pdfminer.six](https://github.com/pdfminer/pdfminer.six) - Secure Text Extraction
- [python-pptx](https://python-pptx.readthedocs.io/) - PowerPoint Generation

## 🚀 How to Use
1. **Upload:** Drag and drop your secret PDF file into the secure uploader.
2. **Convert:** Click the "Convert to Editable PPTX" button.
3. **Download:** Save the resulting presentation directly to your laptop.

## ⚖️ Privacy Policy
This application processes files in your browser's local memory. We do not store, view, or share any of the files you upload.
